        <activityName xml:lang="en">Blast furnace gas, burned in power plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Blast furnace gas, burned in power plant
na;
Synonyms: In UVEK2018 enthalten; 
UUID: e2ca6688-ef52-3e85-a7aa-ae15767c6b45
The module does not include input of fuel (blast furnace gas) because blast furnace gas is treated as a waste product of steel production (i.e. zero allocation to blast furnace gas). Nevertheless, the module includes the emissions caused by the burning of the gas in the power plant. It includes also power plant infrastructure.; Geography: Data from literature, referring to Europe
Location:  Data from literature, referring to Europe
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from literature 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e2ca6688-ef52-3e85-a7aa-ae15767c6b45.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
